      "definition": "./definition.tsx",
      "capability": {
        "title": "Guest Reviews",
        "description": "Marquee of guest review cards that scrolls continuously and loops seamlessly, with star rating, quote, avatar, name, location detail and favourite dish. Pauses on hover, on keyboard focus, or via a pause control, and stops entirely for reduced-motion users. Renders one h2; guest names and ratings are not headings.",
